    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even just stress anymore. it's like... the concept of \"trying\" feels impossible. like even if i took a month off or a year, i'd still wake up with this crushing weight. i feel like i'm just performing being a person, but inside i'm just... gone. there's no more \"me\" to fix or support. i'm just so done with the constant effort.",
