      "content": "I deeply empathize with your pain, and your feelings of hopelessness are being echoed in your words. It can be incredibly frustrating when efforts don't seem to yield the relief hoped for, especially when you're trying so hard. Remember, it's not just you and there are professionals who could offer not only hope but perhaps new strategies tailored to your specific experience. It's okay to yearn for quiet and stillness, but it might also be comforting to explore small, gentle steps toward peace — like maybe spending some quiet time away from your daily routines, or connecting with a friend who understands what you're going through. You're not alone, even though it might not always feel like it.",
